"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_35","text":"What are you doing?! I said lift from there!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_36","text":"I am lifting!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_37","text":"Well, put your back into it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_38","text":"I'm trying my best!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_39","text":"... Neon, scooch over. I'll help you out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_40","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_40","text":"Eden. Cecil's research room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EdenLobby","bgArt":"edenlobby","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_41","text":"Here you are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_edenin","movie":null,"shown":["cecil"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_42","text":"These are the Vapaus bullets made with your blood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_43","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_43","text":"I take both of the bullets. Their deep crimson color makes it seem like I'm holding two rubies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Chap_21_07","bgArt":"eventscene_chap_21_07","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_44","text":"As expected, Mother Whale's core was fused with human cells.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_45","text":"We were also accurate in our prediction that none of the Vapaus ingredients were lost while synthesizing your blood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_46","text":"This is about as perfect a Vapaus bullet that can be made at this point.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_47","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_47","text":"What about Johan?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_48","text":"He's waiting outside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EdenLobby","bgArt":"edenlobby","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["cecil"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_49","text":"It's up to you whether you take him on and keep both bullets or not. Good luck.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_50","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_50","text":"Right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_51","text":"Oh, right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_52","text":"I compared the bullet found in the research room to the current bullets.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_53","text":"There's a significant difference in concentration.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_54","text":"If that bullet you found before was a 10, then this one is a 100.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_55","text":"Maybe even more than that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_56","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_56","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_57","text":"I can't say for sure, but I'm fairly positive this will be fatal for any Heretic. It could also grant any Nikke complete autonomy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_58","text":"Just to be safe, don't get any of your blood on any Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_59","text":"It's exceedingly potent, so much so that we have no idea what it could do to them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_60","text":"Of course, there's no evidence to say something good can't come out of it,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_21_10_e_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_21_10_e_61","text":"but we can't say for sure something terrible wouldn't happen, either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"b